  "description": "Eunsul spends her days doing bookkeeping for a loan office in a rundown part of town. Her quiet routine is upended when the dangerously charming Wookyung Choi suddenly takes an interest in her. He offers to take care of the men making her life difficult—but his help comes with strings attached.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**      \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587013405), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13465725), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/inexpensiveromance19), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/cheap_romance), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000074784), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68900355), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/9093)     \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587013414), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13465883), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/inexpensiveromance), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/cheap_romance_15), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000074788), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68900355), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/9094) \n\n**Official Translations:**     \nR19: [English](https://manta.net/en/series/cheap-romance-full-ver?seriesId=4555), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1001041)",
